                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Friendly clerks. The male clerk may look stressful but it’s actually because he’s cooking in front of a hot stove; not like what some reviews said at all.\n\nThe food is decent and clean. I like the sauce of the danping. I tried the sauce somewhere else and it’s a bit too fishy but this one is good👌. Their meat is quite good. The price is reasonable with air conditioned sometimes.\n\nThe menus are in English and the clerk can speak English too🥰.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
